        "url": "/guides/seed-calculator/",
        "file": "guides/seed-calculator/index.html",
        "title": "How many seeds do you need? | Harbour Notes",
        "description": "An interactive seed estimate for a garden bed.",
        "canonical": "https://reference.example/guides/seed-calculator/",
        "visibleText": "Skip to content Harbour Notes From the east quay Journal Guides A practical guide How many seeds do you need? An interactive seed estimate for a garden bed. Jon Bell · Reviewed 2025-05-03 Use this estimate when packing seeds for a garden bed. It assumes 25 seeds per square metre and adds a 20% reserve. Estimate your seeds Allow 25 seeds per square metre, plus a 20% reserve. Garden bed area in square metres 60 seeds, including the reserve. The estimate changes when you change the area. Check the seed packet for the spacing required by your variety. The shared garden. Original fixture illustration, CC0. Harbour Notes is a fictional publication used as a Reference Site. No Client material is included.",
