        "canonical": "https://reference.example/guides/visiting/",
        "visibleText": "Skip to content Harbour Notes From the east quay Journal Guides A practical guide Plan your visit Opening hours and access to the reading room. Harbour Notes · Reviewed 2025-05-01 The reading room is at 8 East Quay in our fictional harbour neighbourhood. Opening hours Tuesday and Thursday: 10:00 to 17:00. Saturday: 10:00 to 14:00. Closed on other days. Access The quay entrance has step-free access. A quiet table and an accessible toilet are on the ground floor. Assistance dogs are welcome. East quay, Harbour Notes. Original fixture illustration, CC0. Harbour Notes is a fictional publication used as a Reference Site. No Client material is included.",
