        "bodyText": "The reading room is at 8 East Quay in our fictional harbour neighbourhood. Opening hours Tuesday and Thursday: 10:00 to 17:00. Saturday: 10:00 to 14:00. Closed on other days. Access The quay entrance has step-free access. A quiet table and an accessible toilet are on the ground floor. Assistance dogs are welcome. East quay, Harbour Notes. Original fixture illustration, CC0.",
