      {
        "url": "/journal/2025/04/12/harbour-reopens/",
        "file": "journal/2025/04/12/harbour-reopens/index.html",
        "title": "The harbour reading room reopens | Harbour Notes",
        "description": "A new chapter for the reading room on the east quay.",
        "canonical": "https://reference.example/journal/2025/04/12/harbour-reopens/",
        "visibleText": "Skip to content Harbour Notes From the east quay Journal Guides From the journal The harbour reading room reopens A new chapter for the reading room on the east quay. Mara Holm · 2025-04-12 East quay, Harbour Notes. Original fixture illustration, CC0. The reading room on the east quay opened its doors again on 12 April 2025. Volunteers repaired the shelves and brought the long oak table back into use. A room for everyone There is no membership fee. Bring a book, borrow one from the shelf, or sit beside the window with a cup of tea. We wanted a quiet place that still belongs to everyone. Mara Holm, volunteer Find opening hours in our guide to visiting . Harbour Notes is a fictional publication used as a Reference Site. No Client material is included.",
        "publication": {
          "id": "ref-article-001",
          "url": "/journal/2025/04/12/harbour-reopens/",
          "title": "The harbour reading room reopens",
          "description": "A new chapter for the reading room on the east quay.",
          "author": "Mara Holm",
          "featured": true,
          "tags": [
            "harbour",
            "community"
          ],
          "collection": "articles",
          "publishedOn": "2025-04-12",
          "readingMinutes": 2
        },
        "bodyText": "East quay, Harbour Notes. Original fixture illustration, CC0. The reading room on the east quay opened its doors again on 12 April 2025. Volunteers repaired the shelves and brought the long oak table back into use. A room for everyone There is no membership fee. Bring a book, borrow one from the shelf, or sit beside the window with a cup of tea. We wanted a quiet place that still belongs to everyone. Mara Holm, volunteer Find opening hours in our guide to visiting .",
