          "collection": "articles",
          "publishedOn": "2025-05-03",
          "readingMinutes": 3
        },
        "bodyText": "The shared garden. Original fixture illustration, CC0. On 3 May 2025, neighbours brought 18 packets of seeds to the shared garden. Each packet carried the variety, harvest year, and a short note from its grower. What to bring next time Dry seeds in a labelled paper envelope. The year you collected them. A note about the conditions they grew in. Keep a small reserve for gaps in the beds. Our seed calculator includes a 20% reserve.",
